  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHO Gaza Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funded by the SHO campaign, the project aims to respond to the needs of the most vulnerable groups in Gaza, due to the conflict. The response is composed of urgent healthcare services, including primary care, maternal health (including nutritional support and essential items for pregnant and lactating women), and psychosocial support, to displaced populations in the Gaza Strip, reaching an estimated 55,000 beneficiaries in the Middle Area and North Gaza (including Gaza City). The services will focus on pregnant and lactating women, newborns, persons with disabilities and individuals with chronic diseases.</narrative>
  </description>
